<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>EmoteHop Macro for Enhanced Movement</Major>
    <Description>This macro is designed to simplify the execution of EmoteHop in the game Evade on the Roblox platform. EmoteHop is a technique that allows players to effectively navigate the map by using emotes to evade enemy pursuit.

With this macro, you will be able to:

Automate the execution of a sequence of emotes, significantly increasing your movement speed.
Easily customize parameters to optimize performance based on the situation in the game.
Enhance your survivability by avoiding enemy attacks through more agile movement.
This tool is perfect for both beginners and experienced players looking to improve their skills in Evade. Install the macro and feel the difference in your gameplay!</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 224 1
Delay 36 ms
KeyDown 10 1
KeyUp 10 1
KeyDown 30 1
KeyUp 30 1
KeyDown 44 1
GoWhile 7 8
Delay 30 ms
KeyUp 44 1
Delay 30 ms
KeyDown 44 1
Delay 30 ms
KeyUp 44 1
Delay 30 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>